r = fetch_one("SELECT E'a\\#{x}' AS v")
return r.v
$f$;
ERROR:  plxruby: an interpolation cannot follow an unpaired backslash in an E'...' SQL string; write a literal backslash as two backslashes
DETAIL:  at plxruby source line 2
